2026-08-17 09:46:25,173 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'headers': {'anthropic-user-profile-id': <anthropic.Omit object at 0x7fd43c166ea0>}, 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-e96055f5-94d5-4cfb-8813-5bee785be4c9', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://www.aisi.gov.uk/careers)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<body><div class="toast padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="toast_wrapper"><div><div><a class="text-link-background on-dark" href="/frontier-ai-trends-report">Read the Frontier AI Trends Report</a></div><div class="js-disabled"><div class="t-c-gray400">Please enable javascript for this website.</div></div></div><div class="row toast-wrapper"><div class="w-embed"><div class="row toast-wrapper">\n<div class="toast-link text-size-sm" onclick="decreaseFontSize()" tabindex="0">A</div>\n<div class="vertical-rule"></div>\n<div class="toast-link text-size-lg" onclick="increaseFontSize()" tabindex="0">A</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="navigation-wrap on-load"><div class="navigation padding-global w-nav" data-animation="default" data-collapse="medium" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner"><div class="navigation-full container-large"><div class="navigation-container"><a aria-label="AISI Homepage" class="navigation-logo-container w-nav-brand" href="/" title="AISI Homepage"><div class="aisi-logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="aisi-logotype is-white" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/663bd486c5e4c81588db7a1d/663bd707a74f2d5ce76ec1df_722beecd083374105961f1fbce0641c4_AISI%20Logo%20Colour%20White.svg"/><img alt="" class="aisi-logotype is-dark" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/663bd486c5e4c81588db7a1d/663bd707cb0214d8b72951b5_5a103bfcb506b52b4e099f3dc675c649_AISI%20Logo%20Colour%20Dark.svg"/></div></a><div class="navigation-right"><a aria-current="page" class="button is-nav w-inline-block w--current" href="/careers"><div id="w-node-a15d2ff7-2c17-0fa2-931f-dbcde6077f07-e6077eba">Careers</div><div class="icon-xs opacity-50 hide w-embed"></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="navigation-mob padding-global w-nav" data-animation="over-right" data-collapse="medium" data-doc-height="1" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease-out" data-easing2="ease-out" role="banner"><div class="navigation-container-mob"><a class="navigation-logo-container w-nav-brand" href="/"><div class="aisi-logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="aisi-logotype is-white" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/663bd486c5e4c81588db7a1d/663bd707a74f2d5ce76ec1df_722beecd083374105961f1fbce0641c4_AISI%20Logo%20Colour%20White.svg"/><img alt="" class="aisi-logotype is-dark" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/663bd486c5e4c81588db7a1d/663bd707cb0214d8b72951b5_5a103bfcb506b52b4e099f3dc675c649_AISI%20Logo%20Colour%20Dark.svg"/></div></a><div class="navigation-menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="w-embed"></div></div></div></div><div class="global-styles w-embed"></div></div><div class="interior-hero"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-xlarge"><div class="text-size-md">Careers</div><div class="padding-md"></div><h1 class="t-c-white">Shape the UK\'s response to frontier AI</h1><div class="padding-xs"></div><p class="t-c-white text-size-md text-wrap-pretty">We\'re looking for ambitious researchers, engineers, policy analysts and operators from a wide range of backgrounds. </p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="button-wrapper inline-flex"><a class="button is-red w-inline-block" href="#open-roles"><div>View roles</div></a><a class="button is-dark-transparent w-inline-block" href="/blog"><div>View our work</div></a></div><div class="padding-md"></div></div></div></div><img alt="" class="interior-hero-art" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/663bd486c5e4c81588db7a1d/66d6833ba0ccdabe3d64acda_AISI-hero-art-no-blur.svg"/></div><div class="bg-c-gray900"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="max-width-medium align-center text-align-center hide"><h2>Mission</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><p class="text-size-md" data-w-id="875ca6ae-8aa4-cc3b-bb30-8d97f8e3cd11" style="opacity:0">Advanced AI systems offer transformative opportunities to boost economic growth, human creativity, and public education, but they also pose significant risks.\xa0\xa0\xa0AISI was launched at the Bletchley Park AI Safety Summit in 2023 because taking responsible action on this extraordinary technology requires technical expertise about AI to be available in the heart of government.\xa0\xa0Originally called the UK\'s Frontier AI Taskforce, we have evolved into a leading research institution within the UK’s Department of Science, Innovation, and Technology, from where we can: </p></div><div class="hr-200 white"></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><div class="_2x-grid gap-xl"><div class="t-c-white opacity-100"><p>"AISI has built a wonderful group of technical, policy, and civil service experts focused on making AI and AGI go well, and I\'m finding it extremely motivating to do technical work in this interdisciplinary context."</p><p class="text--name">Geoffrey Irving</p><p class="text-title">Chief Scientist</p></div><div class="t-c-white opacity-100"><p>"AISI is situated at the centre of the action where true impact can be made. I\'m excited about the opportunities unfolding in front of us at such a rapid pace."</p><p class="text--name">Professor Yarin Gal</p><p class="text-title">Former Research\xa0Director</p></div></div><div class="padding-xs"></div></div></div></div><div class="section bg-c-white"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div><div class="sticky" data-w-id="a852270b-69b5-04fc-b51c-e6d249388be1" style="opacity:0"><h2 class="heading-medium">Working at AISI</h2></div></div><div class="column"><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><h3>Who thrives here:</h3><ul role="list"><li><strong>Mission-first owners.</strong> You spot what needs doing—at AISI and in the world—and take responsibility.</li><li><strong>Ambitious &amp; agentic.</strong> You’re not daunted by a challenge and want to make a big difference. When you’re blocked, you look for a way.</li><li><strong>Pragmatists.</strong> You track what moves decisions and drop work that doesn’t.</li><li><strong>Bridge-builders.</strong> You’re excited to work across research teams, companies, non-profits, and governments.</li><li><strong>Teammates who care.</strong> You love teams that are highly collaborative and have each other’s backs.</li></ul></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><h3>What we offer:</h3><p><strong>Impact you couldn\'t have anywhere else</strong></p><ul role="list"><li>Incredibly talented, mission-driven and supportive colleagues. </li><li>Direct influence on how frontier AI is governed and deployed globally. </li><li>Work with the Prime Minister’s AI Advisor and leading AI companies. </li><li>Opportunity to shape the first &amp; best-resourced public-interest research team focused on AI security.</li></ul><p><strong>Resources &amp; access</strong> </p><ul role="list"><li>Pre-release access to multiple frontier models and ample compute. </li><li>Extensive operational support so you can focus on research and ship quickly. </li><li>Work with experts across national security, policy, AI research and adjacent sciences. </li></ul><p><strong>Growth &amp; autonomy</strong> </p><ul role="list"><li>If you’re talented and driven, you’ll own important problems early. </li><li>5 days off learning and development, annual stipends for learning and development and funding for conferences and external collaborations. </li><li>Freedom to pursue research bets without product pressure. </li><li>Opportunities to publish and collaborate externally. </li></ul><p><strong>Life &amp; family*</strong> </p><ul role="list"><li>Modern central London office (cafes, food court, gym) or option to work in similar government offices in Birmingham, Cardiff, Darlington, Edinburgh, Salford or Bristol. </li><li>Hybrid working, flexibility for occasional remote work abroad and stipends for work-from-home equipment. </li><li>At least 25 days’ annual leave, 8 public holidays and 3 days off for volunteering.</li><li>Generous paid parental leave (36 weeks of UK statutory leave shared between parents + 3 extra paid weeks + option for additional unpaid time).</li><li>On top of your salary, we contribute 28.97% of your base salary to your pension.</li><li>Discounts and benefits for cycling to work, donations and retail/gyms. </li></ul><p><em>*These benefits apply to full-time employees. Benefits may differ for individuals on other working patterns, secondments, and consulting contracts.</em></p></div><div class="hr-200"></div><div class="rtf-card w-richtext"><h3>Application\xa0Process &amp;\xa0Requirements:</h3><p><strong>Interview Process</strong></p><ul role="list"><li><strong>Technical roles: </strong>Our technical roles\' process includes submitting a CV and short written statement, 1-2 skills assessments such as technical interviews and take-home coding tests and 2-4 interviews, including a conversation with leadership. We tailor this process as needed for each role and candidate. If you\'re applying to our technical roles, this <a href="/careers/privacy-policy" target="_blank">privacy policy</a> applies.</li><li><strong>Non-technical roles: </strong>Our non-technical roles\' process includes submitting a CV, 2-4 interviews including a conversation with leadership and sometimes presentation or take-home task assessments. While our interviews follow civil service requirements, we do not require answering in STAR or other rigid formats. We recommend preparing to speak about your past career experience and how you would approach problems you would face in your AISI role.</li></ul><p><strong>Nationality Requirements &amp;\xa0Visas</strong></p><ul role="list"><li><strong>Technical roles:</strong>\xa0we can hire almost all nationalities and sponsor visas. </li><li><strong>Non-technical roles: </strong>you must meet <a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nationality-rules">civil service nationality requirements</a> (by having Commonwealth citizenship, indefinite leave to remain, EU settled status, or meeting some other criteria).</li></ul><p><strong>National Security Vetting <br/></strong></p><ul role="list"><li>Requirements vary by role and <strong>not all roles require vetting; check each job ad.</strong></li><li>Counter Terrorism Check (CTC)\xa0and Security Clearance (SC) <strong>vettings usually require 2+ years of recent UK residency</strong>. Developed Vetting (DV)\xa0clearances usually require 10+ years. Read more <a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/united-kingdom-security-vetting-clearance-levels/national-security-vetting-clearance-levels">here.</a></li></ul><p><strong>Technical Salaries<br/></strong></p><ul role="list"><li>On technical job ads, you\'ll see our total packages include a "base salary" and a "technical talent allowance". This is civil service terminology. The technical talent allowance is part of your total salary and paychecks; there are no restrictions on how you spend it. </li></ul></div></div></div><div id="open-roles"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="hr-200 is-dark"></div><div class="padding-md"></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div><div class="sticky" data-w-id="d7899d12-9377-0b85-addb-9b47d0038d41" style="opacity:0"><h2 class="heading-medium">Open roles</h2></div></div><div class="column gap-sm"><div><div class="padding-xxs"></div><h2 class="heading-small">Technical roles:</h2></div><div class="max-width-full" data-greenhouse-board="aisi"></div><div class="bg-c-gray50 max-width-full hide" data-no-roles="aisi"><div class="padding-sm"><div>There are no open roles at this time.</div></div></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><h2 class="heading-small">Non-technical roles:</h2><div><div class="max-width-full" data-greenhouse-board="csjobs"></div><div class="bg-c-gray50 max-width-full hide" data-no-roles="csjobs"><div class="padding-sm"><div>There are no open roles at this time.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="padding-xl"></div></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div>\n</body>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
