2026-08-17 09:46:41,271 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'headers': {'anthropic-user-profile-id': <anthropic.Omit object at 0x7fd43c166ea0>}, 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-c298ac17-00f7-42a4-a805-6ca7a4f18ce5', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://www.alignment.org/hiring/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main class="container content" id="content">\n<article class="page post no-image page">\n\n<section class="page__content" id="jlb-content">\n<p>We are currently hiring for two single-opening positions in addition to our ongoing researcher hiring. For questions about any of these roles, please email us at hiring@[domain].org.</p><h2 id="single-opening-positions">Single-opening positions</h2>\n<div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"><a class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent" href="https://jobs.lever.co/alignment.org/92a375c0-e47e-4505-bacc-03eea7772d80">Chief of Staff</a></div><p></p><p>We are hiring a chief of staff to work closely with the executive director (Paul Christiano) and take on significant responsibility for hiring, governance, management, comms, and automation.</p><div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"><a class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent" href="https://jobs.lever.co/alignment.org/84a0dfab-62ee-4576-81cb-ff91a7c2b9cc">Automation Lead</a></div><p></p><p>We are also looking to hire an experienced software engineer to act as our automation lead, taking on strategy and execution for automating ARC\'s research activities using AI.</p><h2 id="researcher-positions">Researcher positions</h2>\n<p><strong><em>Please note: we have temporarily closed our researcher hiring process for the summer months. We plan to re-open hiring in September. In the meantime, applicants should feel free to fill out our expression of interest form; if we are are interested in your application, we will get back to you in or around September.</em></strong></p><div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"><a class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent" href="https://jobs.lever.co/alignment.org/617488b1-d742-4990-a037-b7f0e2ba68c9">Researcher Expression of Interest</a></div><p></p><p>The ARC research team is hiring!</p><p>We are primarily seeking candidates for visiting researcher positions, which we offer year-round. While visiting researcher appointments typically run for 10 weeks, we can be flexible with the duration. Most of our team members join as visiting researchers first, as this allows both sides to ensure a great fit. While we are open to hiring directly for permanent positions, this path has significantly higher requirements.</p><p>Most successful candidates have a strong theoretical background (in math, physics or computer science, for example). Empirical machine learning background is a plus, but is not required for a strong application.</p>\n</section>\n</article>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
