631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_poster.0000000.jpg")\'><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_mp4.mp4"/><source data-wf-ignore="true" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7%2F69fa7cbf00f97b5f2e2d8f49_LightLeaks_Dark_10s_Looped_webm.webm"/></video></div></section><div class="background-fill overlay"></div></section><section class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-_298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5a3-d72d58a1"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="sticky"><h2 class="heading-medium">The Hardest Problems Emerge at the Edge of AI</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>The most interesting, and messiest, problems show up at the edges.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="padding-md hide-tablet"></div></div></div><div class="column gap-0"><div class="left-border-card-wrapper"><div class="padding-lg hide-tablet"></div><div class="border-left"></div><p>Gray Swan has made a habit of being first in line. We’re often the first to spot new failure modes, and, by extension, the first to defend against them. Being research-first isn’t a tagline. It’s how we build our products, our playbooks, and our culture of thinking three steps ahead.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>Whether it’s stress-testing the latest agentic AI in a lab or helping enterprises deploy at full speed, our goal is the same: uncover the hard problems before anyone else does, then turn that insight into real-world solutions that let innovation happen, safely and without slowing down.</p></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper"><div class="border-left"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper hide-tablet"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="border-left"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="b