e petition</a>\xa0as a “a step backward” and “the worst kind of protectionism.” The three groups recently joined SEIA and others as members of ETAC.</p></blockquote>\n<p><section class="publication-slider alignfull" id="block-f53cbe4628a8f68cd42badf58746a580">\n<div class="container">\n<div class="publication-slider__heading-row">\n<h2 class="publication-slider__subtitle kicker">Featured Publications</h2>\n</div>\n<div class="publication-slider__wrap wow animate__animated animate__fadeInRight">\n<div class="publication-slider__grid grid 1">\n<article class="grid-post column">\n<div class="grid-post__thumb-wrap"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/commentary/statement-on-fbis-2025-reported-crimes-in-the-nation/"><img alt="" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" decoding="async" height="361" loading="lazy" sizes="auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" src="https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/shutterstock_1072282619.jpg" srcset="https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/shutterstock_1072282619.jpg 1000w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/shutterstock_1072282619-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.rstreet.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/shutterstock_1072282619-768x433.jpg 768w" width="640"/></a></div> <div class="grid-post__content">\n<div class="grid-post__top-meta">\n<span class="grid-post__types">News</span> <span class="grid-post__areas"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/home/our-issues/criminal-justice-and-civil-liberties/">Criminal Justice and Civil Liberties</a>, <a href="https://www.rstreet.org/issues/policing/">Policing</a></span> </div>\n<h3 class="grid-post__title medium-headline"><a href="https://www.rstreet.org/commentary/statement-on-fbis-2025-reported-crimes-in-the-nation/">Statement on FBI’s 2025 Reported Crimes in the Nation</a></h3>\n<div class="grid-post__bottom-meta">\n<span class="grid-post__authors">\n\t\t\t\t\tJohn Grover\t\t\t\t</span>\n<span class="grid-post__date">Aug 14, 2026</span> </div>\n</div>\n</a